{title: Heavenly Father I Appreciate You}
{key: C}

{comment: Chorus}
Heavenly [C]Father, I ap[F]preciate [C]You,
Heavenly [C]Father, I ap[Am]preciate [Dm]You,[G7]
I [C]love You, a[C7]dore You,
I [F]bow down be[Fm]fore You
Heavenly [C/E]Father, I ap[G]preciate [F]You[C]

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]Jesus what a [F]wonder You [C]are
